%% draw-visual:
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant C as Client
  participant N as Node a
  participant D as Local FS (WAL)
  participant S3 as SeaweedFS S3
  C->>N: write S3
  N->>D: -wal fsync
  N->>S3: put segment (If-None-Match)
  S3-->>N: 200 ok (S3)
  N->>D: checkpoint
  N->>D: catalog fsync
  Note over N,D: strace SIGKILL on fsync
  N--xC: ok (lost)
  Note over C,S3: wipe local dir, Claim from S3
  S3-->>N: restore (version = ack + 1)
